      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7489,
        "name": "Nibelung",
        "desc": "<p>The leader of the elemental dragons and the primeval creator of Teyvat.</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2025/03/03/237301566/596896f7ea3d51d7b1f6e504094f9d97_4010709984094972573.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 10
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "The primeval dragon created three Moon Goddesses and the Three Moons, and raised them to the sky. During the",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 9095,
        "name": "War of Funerary Flame",
        "desc": "<p>The war between the Dragon Lord Nibelung and the Heavenly Principles that took place 6,000 years ago.</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/01/21/237301566/693da8a1b01352fde999598e49b34fde_8792145013995754059.png",
        "displayStyle": "text"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "Nibelung imprisoned the Moon Goddesses and turned their Moons into weapons.",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7625,
        "name": "Moon Goddesses",
        "desc": "<p>Aria, Sonnet, and Canon — three sisters and Moon Goddesses who once ruled the firmament. Columbina Hyposelenia is a Moon Goddess who was born thousands of years after the Three Moon's death.</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2025/04/07/237301566/1f76253cb02cf46c0f6d8b836271b6f2_7450418426638299855.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 23
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "Sonnet was the Goddess of the Iridescent Moon — the third and smallest of the Moons. Most of the time, her light was barely visible to the naked eye — yet when she shone, her fleeting halos were all the more mysterious for it. When the Iridescent Moon shattered, it merged with the Abyss to survive and became the Crimson Moon.",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 4811,
        "desc": "",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 22
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "The Crimson Moon Dynasty worshipped the Crimson Moon and the Abyss through her. They used the Moon's shards to gain powers and created an orphanage to receive children from beyond the bounds of this world. The Crimson Moon sages looked beyond this world for beings with powers that surpassed the gods — the Descenders.\nMoon Marrow\nThe Iridescent Moon shard that contains Sonnet's power. A descendant of the Crimson Moon Dynasty,",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7477,
        "name": "Arlecchino",
        "desc": "<p>The Fourth of the Eleven Fatui Harbingers, known as The Knave. Her real name is Peruere.</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2025/06/14/237301566/87e4301d75fef8a894e351dd8b01b2fb_5348351308756202419.png",
        "displayStyle": "text",
        "menuId": 10
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": ", wields the Iridescent Moon's marrow. The ancient Balemoon Bloodfire flowed through her veins — the Iridescent Moon's powers corrupted by the Abyss.",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 9338,
        "name": "Aria",
        "desc": "<p>Goddess of the Eternal Moon.</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/01/20/237301566/a2acc52e0870cb103da56037249720e4_9196180589245173426.png",
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 9340,
        "name": "Canon",
        "desc": "<p>The Goddess of the Frost Moon.</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/01/20/237301566/83ad656e45f97e90387a110a29206acf_6638456880554064410.png",
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "Sonnet is the youngest of the Moon Goddesses.",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7476,
        "name": "Columbina",
        "desc": "<p>The Trilune Goddess and the former Third of the Eleven Fatui Harbingers, known as Damselette. Her real name is Columbina Hyposelenia.</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/02/15/237301566/5e2419a3a72fa7e5e3b9f9009281dbbb_5980869753315871646.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 10
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "The new Moon Goddess. Aria, Sonnet, and Canon gave her their powers, thus making her the Trilune Goddess.",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
